# The Courier Guy — Integration Plan (Satya Pooja Kit Orders)

End-to-end plan for **The Courier Guy (TCG / ShipLogic)** door-to-door shipping: quotes at checkout, delivery fee on order total, automatic shipment after payment, and tracking in the mobile app and admin panel.

**API docs:** https://api-tcg.co.za/  

| Environment | Base URL | When |
|-------------|----------|------|
| **Test (default in dev)** | `https://api-sandbox.shiplogic.com` | `TCG_API_ENV=test` or `NODE_ENV` ≠ `production` |
| **Production** | `https://api-tcg.co.za` | `TCG_API_ENV=production` |
| **Mock (no HTTP)** | — | `TCG_USE_MOCK=true` |

---

## 1. Business goal

| Step | Who | What happens |
|------|-----|----------------|
| 1 | User | Selects Pooja Kit(s), adds to cart |
| 2 | User | Enters delivery address (South Africa) |
| 3 | Backend | Calls TCG **rates** API → returns delivery options + prices + ETA |
| 4 | User | Chooses **Express (~1–2 days)** or **Standard (~3–4 days)** |
| 5 | User | Sees **Product subtotal + delivery = total** |
| 6 | User | Pays via **Paystack** (full total) |
| 7 | Backend | Creates TCG **shipment** → waybill / tracking number |
| 8 | System | Syncs tracking → updates order status + push + inbox notifications |

---

## 2. User journey (mobile)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User App
  participant B as Satya API
  participant T as The Courier Guy
  participant P as Paystack

  U->>B: POST /shipping/quotes (address + cart)
  B->>T: POST /rates (D2D)
  T-->>B: OVN + ECO rates
  B-->>U: options (price, ETA)

  U->>B: POST /orders/checkout + deliveryOption
  B-->>U: order (subtotal, shipping, total)

  U->>P: Pay order.totalAmount
  P-->>B: webhook / verify
  B->>T: POST /shipments
  T-->>B: waybill + shipment id
  B-->>U: order with tracking

  loop Every 15 min + on demand
    B->>T: GET /tracking/shipments
    T-->>B: status + events
    B-->>U: SHIPPED / DELIVERED notifications
  end
```

---

## 3. Delivery options shown in the app

TCG returns multiple **service levels**. We expose two to the user:

| App label | `optionKey` | TCG `serviceLevelCode` | Typical ETA (from TCG) |
|-----------|-------------|------------------------|-------------------------|
| Express delivery | `express` | `OVN` (Overnight) | ~1–2 business days |
| Standard delivery | `standard` | `ECO` (Economy) | ~3–4 business days |

Configurable via env: `TCG_OFFERED_SERVICE_LEVELS=OVN,ECO`

---

## 4. Backend architecture (implemented)

```
src/config/courierGuy.js              → env, warehouse address, parcel defaults
src/utils/saAddressZones.js           → province → TCG zone (GP, WC, KZN, …)
src/services/courierGuyClient.js      → HTTP: /rates, /shipments, /tracking
src/services/shippingQuoteService.js  → build parcels, map rates → app options
src/services/courierGuyShipmentService.js → create shipment after pay, sync tracking
src/services/courierGuyTrackingSyncService.js → cron every 15 min
src/routes/shippingRoutes.js          → POST /shipping/quotes
src/services/orderService.js          → subtotal + shipping on checkout, pricing validation
src/services/paymentService.js        → createShipmentForOrder after Paystack success
```

### Order pricing fields

| Field | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| `subtotalAmount` | Sum of product line totals only |
| `shippingAmount` | Selected TCG option price |
| `totalAmount` | `subtotalAmount + shippingAmount` (Paystack charges this) |

### `order.delivery` snapshot

| Field | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `provider` | `THE_COURIER_GUY` |
| `serviceLevelCode` | `OVN` or `ECO` |
| `serviceLevelName` | e.g. Overnight |
| `optionKey` | `express` / `standard` |
| `label` | UI label stored on order |
| `estimatedDeliveryFrom` / `To` | From TCG quote |
| `shipmentId` | TCG shipment id (after pay) |
| `waybill` | Tracking reference e.g. `TCGD000500` |
| `shipmentStatus` | TCG status string |
| `trackingEvents[]` | `{ status, message, at, location }` |

### `order.tracking` (existing + auto-filled)

| Field | Set when |
|-------|----------|
| `courier` | `The Courier Guy` |
| `trackingNumber` | Waybill from TCG |
| `trackingUrl` | Public track URL + waybill |
| `dispatchedAt` | Auto when status → SHIPPED |
| `deliveredAt` | Auto when status → DELIVERED |

---

## 5. API reference (Satya backend)

Base: `/api/v1`  
Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <user_jwt>` unless noted.

### 5.1 Get delivery quotes

**When:** After user enters shipping address (before payment).

```http
POST /api/v1/shipping/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "shippingAddress": {
    "fullName": "Jane Doe",
    "phone": "0821234567",
    "addressLine1": "12 Main Road",
    "city": "Cape Town",
    "state": "Western Cape",
    "postalCode": "8001",
    "country": "South Africa"
  }
}
```

Optional: pass `items` instead of using cart:

```json
{
  "shippingAddress": { ... },
  "items": [{ "productId": "674a...", "quantity": 2 }],
  "useCart": false
}
```

**Success `200` (example):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Delivery options fetched",
  "data": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "THE_COURIER_GUY",
    "subtotalAmount": 450,
    "currency": "ZAR",
    "kitCount": 2,
    "options": [
      {
        "optionKey": "express",
        "serviceLevelCode": "OVN",
        "serviceLevelName": "Overnight",
        "label": "Express delivery",
        "subtitle": "Expect delivery between 1 - 2 business days.",
        "price": 120.5,
        "currency": "ZAR",
        "estimatedDeliveryFrom": "2026-05-20T00:00:00.000Z",
        "estimatedDeliveryTo": "2026-05-22T00:00:00.000Z"
      },
      {
        "optionKey": "standard",
        "serviceLevelCode": "ECO",
        "serviceLevelName": "Economy",
        "label": "Standard delivery",
        "subtitle": "Expect delivery between 3 - 4 business days.",
        "price": 85,
        "currency": "ZAR",
        "estimatedDeliveryFrom": "2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "estimatedDeliveryTo": "2026-05-26T00:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**If TCG not configured:** `enabled: false` + message (503 on strict paths).

---

### 5.2 Checkout (create order with delivery)

**When:** User confirms cart + address + delivery option.

```http
POST /api/v1/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "shippingAddress": { ... same as quotes ... },
  "deliveryOption": {
    "serviceLevelCode": "OVN",
    "shippingAmount": 120.5
  }
}
```

**Rules:**

- `deliveryOption` is **required** when TCG is enabled (`TCG_API_KEY` + warehouse address set).
- Server **re-quotes** TCG and rejects if `shippingAmount` differs by more than `TCG_SHIPPING_PRICE_TOLERANCE` (default **R1**) → **`409`** “Delivery price has changed”.
- Response order includes `subtotalAmount`, `shippingAmount`, `totalAmount`, `delivery`.

Alternative: `POST /api/v1/orders` with same body + optional `items` / `paymentMethod`.

---

### 5.3 Pay (unchanged Paystack flow)

```http
POST /api/v1/payments/initialize
{ "orderId": "<orderId>" }

GET /api/v1/payments/verify/:reference
```

Paystack amount = **`order.totalAmount`** (products + shipping).

**After successful payment (automatic):**

1. Stock deducted (existing logic)  
2. `notifyOrderPlaced` → push + inbox `ORDER_PLACED`  
3. **`createShipmentForOrder`** → TCG `POST /shipments`  
4. Order → `PROCESSING`, `tracking.trackingNumber` = waybill  
5. Emails / invoice (existing)

---

### 5.4 Refresh tracking (user or admin)

```http
POST /api/v1/orders/:orderId/sync-courier-tracking
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

Pulls latest events from TCG and may advance:

- `PROCESSING` / `PLACED` → **`SHIPPED`** when TCG reports in-transit / collected  
- → **`DELIVERED`** when TCG reports delivered  

Also sends **`ORDER_SHIPPED`** / **`ORDER_DELIVERED`** inbox + FCM (existing notification pipeline).

**Background:** scheduler runs every **15 minutes** (`TCG_TRACKING_SYNC_INTERVAL_MS`, default 900000).

---

### 5.5 Admin dispatch (optional manual step)

If TCG already created a waybill, admin can mark shipped without re-entering tracking:

```http
POST /api/v1/orders/:id/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer <admin_jwt>

{ "note": "Handed to courier" }
```

If no waybill yet, admin still uses full body:

```json
{
  "courier": "The Courier Guy",
  "trackingNumber": "TCGD000500",
  "trackingUrl": "https://...",
  "note": "Dispatched"
}
```

---

## 6. The Courier Guy API mapping

| Satya action | TCG endpoint | Method |
|--------------|--------------|--------|
| Quote | `/rates` | POST |
| Create shipment | `/shipments` | POST |
| Track by shipment id | `/tracking/shipments?id={id}` | GET |
| Public track by waybill | `/tracking/shipments/public?waybill=` | GET |

**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer {TCG_API_KEY}` and query `api_key={TCG_API_KEY}`  
**Key format:** `accountId|secret` (from TCG / ShipLogic portal)

**D2D rates request (conceptual):**

- `collection_address` — warehouse (from env)  
- `delivery_address` — user shipping address  
- `parcels[]` — dimensions/weight (defaults: 40×30×8 cm, 2 kg × kit qty)

**Create shipment** additionally requires:

- `collection_contact` / `delivery_contact` (name, email, mobile)  
- `service_level_code` — `OVN` or `ECO` from user selection  

---

## 7. Environment variables

Add to `.env` (see `.env.example`):

```env
# test (sandbox) | production — dev defaults to test
TCG_API_ENV=test

# Optional: no real TCG calls (Flutter / local backend)
# TCG_USE_MOCK=true

# Sandbox API key from TCG / ShipLogic portal (NOT production key)
TCG_API_KEY=yourSandboxAccountId|yourSandboxSecret

# Only if support gives a different test host:
# TCG_API_BASE_URL=https://api-sandbox.shiplogic.com

# Warehouse (collection) — JSON recommended
TCG_COLLECTION_ADDRESS_JSON={"type":"business","company":"Satya","street_address":"...","city":"Johannesburg","code":"2000","zone":"GP","country":"South Africa","entered_address":"..."}
TCG_COLLECTION_CONTACT_JSON={"name":"Warehouse","email":"warehouse@example.com","mobile_number":"+27821234567"}

# Or split fields:
# TCG_COLLECTION_STREET=...
# TCG_COLLECTION_CITY=...
# TCG_COLLECTION_POSTAL_CODE=...
# TCG_COLLECTION_ZONE=GP
# TCG_COLLECTION_CONTACT_NAME=...
# TCG_COLLECTION_CONTACT_EMAIL=...
# TCG_COLLECTION_CONTACT_PHONE=...

# Parcel defaults (one consolidated parcel per order)
TCG_DEFAULT_PARCEL_LENGTH_CM=40
TCG_DEFAULT_PARCEL_WIDTH_CM=30
TCG_DEFAULT_PARCEL_HEIGHT_CM=8
TCG_DEFAULT_PARCEL_WEIGHT_KG=2

# App-facing service levels
TCG_OFFERED_SERVICE_LEVELS=OVN,ECO

# Price mismatch tolerance on checkout (ZAR)
TCG_SHIPPING_PRICE_TOLERANCE=1

# Tracking poll interval (ms)
TCG_TRACKING_SYNC_INTERVAL_MS=900000

TCG_TRACKING_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://www.thecourierguy.co.za/track
```

**Enable check:**

- `TCG_USE_MOCK=true` → enabled without API key  
- Else → `TCG_API_KEY` + collection address + contact  

---

## 7b. Test API modes (use these in UAT / local)

### Mode A — Mock (fastest, no TCG account)

```env
TCG_USE_MOCK=true
```

- Quotes return fixed **Express** / **Standard** prices  
- Shipment waybill: `TCGD-MOCK-9001`, etc.  
- Response includes `apiEnvironment: "mock"`  

### Mode B — Sandbox HTTP (real test API)

```env
TCG_API_ENV=test
TCG_API_KEY=<sandbox_accountId|sandbox_secret>
TCG_COLLECTION_ADDRESS_JSON={...}
TCG_COLLECTION_CONTACT_JSON={...}
```

- Calls **`https://api-sandbox.shiplogic.com`** (`POST /rates`, `POST /shipments`)  
- Use credentials from **ShipLogic / TCG sandbox** portal (not live billing)  
- Logs prefixed `[tcg:test]`  

### Mode C — Production

```env
NODE_ENV=production
TCG_API_ENV=production
TCG_API_KEY=<live_key>
```

- Calls **`https://api-tcg.co.za`**

### Quote response flags (all modes)

```json
{
  "apiEnvironment": "test",
  "apiBaseUrl": "https://api-sandbox.shiplogic.com",
  "isTestApi": true
}
```

