## 12. cURL examples (local)

```bash
BASE=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
TOKEN=<user_jwt>

# 1) Quotes
curl -s -X POST "$BASE/shipping/quotes" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "shippingAddress": {
      "fullName": "Test User",
      "phone": "0821234567",
      "addressLine1": "1 Long Street",
      "city": "Cape Town",
      "state": "Western Cape",
      "postalCode": "8001",
      "country": "South Africa"
    }
  }'

# 2) Checkout (use serviceLevelCode + shippingAmount from quote)
curl -s -X POST "$BASE/orders/checkout" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "shippingAddress": { ... },
    "deliveryOption": {
      "serviceLevelCode": "OVN",
      "shippingAmount": 120.5
    }
  }'

# 3) Sync tracking
curl -s -X POST "$BASE/orders/<orderId>/sync-courier-tracking" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN"
```

