## 13. Known limitations & follow-ups

| Item | Status | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Single parcel per order | Current | Weight = `2 kg × total kit qty`; dims from env |
| Per-product weight/dims | Future | Add fields on `Product` or inventory kit |
| Geocoding lat/lng | Optional | TCG accepts `entered_address`; lat/lng improves accuracy |
| Locker delivery (D2L/L2L) | Not in v1 | TCG supports lockers — separate UI flow |
| Cancel shipment on order cancel | Future | `PUT /shipments/{id}` cancel |
| Admin “retry shipment” API | Future | For failed post-payment creates |
| COD orders | Partial | Shipment also created on COD `createOrder` |

---

## 14. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Check |
|---------|--------|
| `503` on quotes | `TCG_API_KEY`, collection JSON env vars |
| `502` Courier Guy API error | Key format, account active, TCG sandbox vs prod |
| No shipment after pay | Logs `[tcg] createShipmentForOrder`; order must have `delivery.serviceLevelCode` |
| Checkout requires deliveryOption | Expected when TCG enabled |
| Tracking never updates | Scheduler running; call sync endpoint; verify `delivery.shipmentId` |
| Admin dispatch fails “tracking required” | Wait for auto waybill or pass `trackingNumber` |

